, I can't recommend <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unknown_Armies\" target=\"_blank\">Unknown Armies </a>strongly enough. Some things that could happen in this game -<br /> <br /> * You meet a homeless person when you're walking back from a bar, and pass by without giving them any change. They trap you in some kind of magical otherworld running on stream-of-consciousness logic that you can only escape when Jesus (as in, a latin-american ambulance driver named Jesus) saves you.<br /> <br /> * You get limited powers of telekinesis, but only while you're drunk.<br /> <br /> * Demons possess you, and force you to go to Taco Bell to eat until you throw up.<br /> <br /> * The Comte St. Germain appears to you in the form of a street musician to ask you strange questions and then vanish without explanation.<br /> <br /> * You begin understand the underlying nature of the world, but now you're scarred, alone, and probably insane.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T12:18:04-08:00","id":303585,"title":"","content":"Savage Worlds for simplicity with adaptability.<br /> <br /> Paranoia for one shot games.<br /> <br /> Star Wars, Pick your poison there are 